#
# Captive Portal clients in hardware: XGS: Settings. Each run writes the portal's sessions to the
# driver as live users every two seconds for 58 seconds, so a login is in hardware and a logout out
# of it within two seconds; with the setting off it empties the table once and ends. A run that
# finds another watching waits for it, so the minutes join.
* * * * * root /usr/local/opnsense/scripts/xgs/cp_users.py --for 58 > /dev/null 2>&1
